{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06417","headline":"弹棋歌 · 李颀","name":"弹棋歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崔侯善弹棋，巧妙尽於此。\n蓝田美玉清如砥，白黑相分十二子。\n联翩百中皆造微，魏文手巾不足比。\n缘边度陇未可嘉，鸟跂星悬危复斜。\n回飙转指速飞电，拂四取五旋风花。\n坐中齐声称绝艺，仙人六博何能继。\n一别常山道路遥，爲余更作三五势。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}